a\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Anti-Sustain Aura build for Estes.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes#build-roam-anti-sustain-aura\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-02T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T967,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Estes in Mobile Legends: Roam Revitalize Deathball\",\"description\":\"Grouped five-man setup for drafts that fight around one protected core and can stack Revitalize with Estes' ultimate before the enemy disengages.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Demon Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Revitalize Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Demon Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Demon Boots (720 gold) as item 1 in the Roam Revitalize Deathball build for Estes.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes#build-roam-revitalize-deathball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Flask of the Oasis\",\"text\":\"Purchase Flask of the Oasis (1,850 gold) as item 2 in the Roam Revitalize Deathball build for Estes.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes#build-roam-revitalize-deathball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Fleeting Time\",\"text\":\"Purchase Fleeting Time (2,050 gold) as item 3 in the Roam Revitalize Deathball build for Estes.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes#build-roam-revitalize-deathball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Enchanted Talisman\",\"text\":\"Purchase Enchanted Talisman (2,070 gold) as item 4 in the Roam Revitalize Deathball build for Estes.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes#build-roam-revitalize-deathball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Oracle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Oracle (1,860 gold) as item 5 in the Roam Revitalize Deathball build for Estes.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes#build-roam-revitalize-deathball\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Guardian Helmet\",\"text\":\"Purchase Guardian Helmet (2,500 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Revitalize Deathball build for Estes.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes#build-roam-revitalize-deathball\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/estes\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-02T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":34,\"name\":\"Estes\",\"slug\":\"estes\",\"title\":\"Moon Elf King\",\"role\":[\"Support\"],\"specialty\":[\"Regen\",\"Guard\"],\"lane\":[\"Roam\"],\"tier\":\"A\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":70,\"offense\":10,\"controlEffect\":20,\"difficulty\":30},\"winRate\":52.68,\"pickRate\":0.74,\"banRate\":43.17,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"valir\",\"heroName\":\"Valir\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Estes counters heroes with no burst damage, he can easily heal through minor damages from heroes like Faramis and Alice.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"alice\",\"heroName\":\"Alice\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Estes counters heroes with no burst damage, he can easily heal through minor damages from heroes like Faramis and Alice.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Estes is countered by heroes with high burst damage. Heroes like Saber and Eudora can easily burst down Estes or the hero he protects in a few seconds.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"eudora\",\"heroName\":\"Eudora\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Estes is countered by heroes with high burst damage. Heroes like Saber and Eudora can easily burst down Estes or the hero he protects in a few seconds.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_137acad8cd747ef9d0dec755158aff18.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ff4de3b0aabd1d2f6e184db1c831f6a9.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"44\",\"heroName\":\"Grock\",\"heroSlug\":\"grock\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_47c9a9a373919fd9cc0c68ff7788b32a.png\",\"tip\":\"Grock has a skill of blocking enemies way, Minotaur his rage skill will make the enemies stop moving while Tigreal has the skill of moving out the enemies.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"8\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/1691dbbde8237768590768a90510d5a6.jpg?w=100-100-f7fcc4\",\"tip\":\"Estes can do his part on the battle ground.Protect teammates from assassin.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"21\",\"heroName\":\"Hayabusa\",\"heroSlug\":\"hayabusa\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/3de2f55e701a340a02f1828e79cdb9fa.png?w=150-150-1f1820\",\"tip\":\"We all know that Estes is a long range support mage, there for any short range heroes can easily defeat Estes such as assassin like Saber, Karina and Hayabusa.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Scripture of the Moon Elf\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Scripture of the Moon Elf slowly charges energy for Estes. Upon reaching 100 stacks, it enhances his next Basic Attack, dealing 250 (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the target. The attack will ricochet to nearby enemies, dealing 125 (+50% Total Physical Attack) (+75% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing them by 60% for 1.5s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Scripture of the Moon Elf\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" slowly charges energy for Estes. Upon reaching 100 stacks, it enhances his next Basic Attack, dealing 250\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+150% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to the target. The attack will ricochet to nearby enemies, dealing 125\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+75% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and slowing them by 60% for 1.5s.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0eb30f512750394ac949651d801d92f0.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Moonlight Immersion\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Estes recovers 200 (+110% Total Magic Power) HP for the target allied hero immediately and links himself with them for 5s.\\nWhile linked, both heroes gain 15 (+10% Total Magic Power) Hybrid Defense, and the target slowly recovers 360 (+90% Total Magic Power) HP. Linking with an allied hero increases Estes' Movement Speed by 15%, as well as the energy charging speed of the Scripture of the Moon Elf.\\nBeing too far from the target will break the link.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Estes recovers 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+110% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" HP for the target allied hero immediately and links himself with them for 5s.\\nWhile linked, both heroes gain 15\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+10% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Hybrid Defense, and the target slowly recovers 360\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+90% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" HP. Linking with an allied hero increases Estes' Movement Speed by 15%, as well as the energy charging speed of the Scripture of the Moon Elf.\\nBeing too far from the target will break the link.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"11s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f5b04cea7f95a5fd378699c764f39384.png\",\"tags\":[\"Heal\",\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Domain of Moon Goddess\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Estes drops a flood of moonlight on the target area, dealing 350 (+70% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemy units within it. Afterwards, it turns to a domain of the Moon Goddess and reveals enemies inside it. Enemies will be slowed by 90% for 1.5s if they touch the edge of the domain area. (The slow effect will decay over time.)\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Estes drops a flood of moonlight on the target area, dealing 350\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+70% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemy units within it. Afterwards, it turns to a domain of the Moon Goddess and reveals enemies inside it. Enemies will be slowed by 90% for 1.5s if they touch the edge of the domain area. (The slow effect will decay over time.)\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12s\",\"manaCost\":\"80\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_207a8204b952f50031ad3ca3c6abea42.png\",\"tags\":[\"Slow\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Blessing of Moon Goddess\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Estes casts an enhanced Moonlight Immersion on himself and all nearby allied heroes, refreshing Moonlight Immersion on them and enhancing it for 8s.\\nEnhanced Moonlight Immersion: Doubles the Instant Basic Healing and Hybrid Defense Increase, and heals the target for 1020 (+225% Total Magic Power) HP over time.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Estes casts an enhanced \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Moonlight Immersion\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on himself and all nearby allied heroes, refreshing \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Moonlight Immersion\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on them and enhancing it for 8s.\\nEnhanced \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Moonlight Immersion\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Doubles the Instant Basic Healing and Hybrid Defense Increase, and heals the target for 1020\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+225% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" HP over time.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"55s\",\"manaCost\":\"140\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0bc801eaf911ceb696997fbe43105440.png\",\"tags\":[\"Heal\",\"Buff\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2-0-1/2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"This can use for defense or offense. Since Estes is vulnerably squishy, also the first target of the enemies. Estes can use Flicker from escaping the enemies. He can also use Flicker on catching up to allies who needed his help especially his healing.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This can use for defense or offense. Since Estes is vulnerably squishy, also the first target of the enemies. Estes can use Flicker from escaping the enemies. He can also use Flicker on catching up to allies who needed his help especially his healing.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"lesley\",\"heroName\":\"Lesley\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Estes works best with typical Marksman heroes, his healing will allow them to deal more damage. Heroes like Lesley and Hanabi are good examples here.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hanabi\",\"heroName\":\"Hanabi\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Estes works best with typical Marksman heroes, his healing will allow them to deal more damage. Heroes like Lesley and Hanabi are good examples here.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Estes should use his 2nd Skill to slow down the enemy team, then heal his teammates with his Ultimate and 1st Skill.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":3420,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_207a8204b952f50031ad3ca3c6abea42.png\"},{\"skillId\":3430,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0bc801eaf911ceb696997fbe43105440.png\"},{\"skillId\":3410,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f5b04cea7f95a5fd378699c764f39384.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Estes can use his 2nd Skill to slow down and poke enemies, and heal allies with his 1st Skill.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":3420,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_207a8204b952f50031ad3ca3c6abea42.png\"},{\"skillId\":3410,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f5b04cea7f95a5fd378699c764f39384.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Estes build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Link economy over raw healing, when NOT to pick him, ult timing, and anti-heal counterplay.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Estes is not a healer. He is a link economy, a five-second tether that keeps one specific teammate alive while the rest of your team plays around an indestructible target. The pick wins when your draft has that target, and loses hard when it does not.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"estes\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-02\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"roam-favor-reset\",\"name\":\"Roam Favor Reset\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"demon-boots\",\"name\":\"Demon Boots\",\"cost\":720,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"cost\":1850,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"fleeting-time\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\",\"cost\":2150,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\"},{\"slug\":\"fleeting-time\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"support\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"pull-yourself-together\",\"name\":\"Pull Yourself Together\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/pull-yourself-together.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"focusing-mark\",\"name\":\"Focusing Mark\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/focusing-mark.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"purify\",\"name\":\"Purify\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"favor\",\"name\":\"Favor\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when enemy sustain or attack-speed carries keep fighting through the first healing cycle.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against physical skill burst from assassins or fighters that dive straight onto Estes.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against repeated magic poke or burn rather than a single mage burst combo.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"guardian-helmet\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when recalls are costing objective control and the enemy cannot instantly punish the missing revive.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked Estes setup built around Favor, Flask, ultimate resets, and enough self-survival to cast Purify before the heal window is cancelled.\",\"totalCost\":10750,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Fleeting Time\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":3450,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Fleeting Time\",\"Oracle\",\"Athena's Shield\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"hpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hpRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":2,\"sources\":[\"Athena's Shield\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":68,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\",\"Athena's Shield\"]},{\"key\":\"mpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.manaRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Demon Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Demon Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Fleeting Time\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"healingEffect\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.healingEffect\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":12,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=estes\u0026items=demon-boots%2Cflask-of-the-oasis%2Cfleeting-time%2Coracle%2Cathenas-shield%2Cimmortality\u0026blessing=favor\u0026spell=purify\u0026emblem=support\u0026talents=agility%2Cpull-yourself-together%2Cfocusing-mark\u0026flex=dominance-ice.athenas-shield%2Cantique-cuirass.athenas-shield%2Cradiant-armor.athenas-shield%2Cguardian-helmet.immortality\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"roam-anti-sustain-aura\",\"name\":\"Roam Anti-Sustain Aura\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"cost\":1850,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"cost\":2070,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\"},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"support\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"wilderness-blessing\",\"name\":\"Wilderness Blessing\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/wilderness-blessing.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"focusing-mark\",\"name\":\"Focusing Mark\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/focusing-mark.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"favor\",\"name\":\"Favor\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy has low crowd control and faster Moonlight Immersion cycles matter more than Fortitude.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy healers or shielders can avoid Dominance Ice range and need Lifebane applied by Domain of Moon Goddess. The two Lifebanes do not stack, so take the one that reaches them.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when a burst mage can delete Estes before Oracle's self-healing value matters.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when repeated physical skill damage is reaching Estes through the front line.\"}],\"notes\":\"Close-range utility setup for sustain mirrors where Estes must live in Dominance Ice's Lifebane aura range to suppress enemy healing.\",\"totalCost\":10610,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":135,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Enchanted Talisman\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\