.com/wiki/Estes/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Red Crow\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Special\",\"tagSlug\":\"special\",\"price\":\"2021/01 StarLight Reward\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero345-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/estes/Hero345-portrait-20220525165045.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Estes/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Arcane Judicator\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Special\",\"tagSlug\":\"special\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":null,\"portraitUrl\":null,\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Estes/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Estes is the Moon Elf King, the wise and benevolent ruler of the Moonlight Forest and supreme healer of the Land of Dawn. He wields the Scripture of the Moon Elf, an ancient tome that channels lunar energy into restorative magic capable of sustaining entire armies through the most brutal sieges. When the Abyss corrupted the Moonlight Forest and scattered his people, Estes took up his staff and joined the front lines, his healing aura a beacon of hope in the darkest battles. His devotion to his people is absolute, and he has sworn to restore the Moon Elves to their former glory, no matter how many wars he must heal his allies through to achieve it.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"miya\",\"heroName\":\"Miya\",\"relationship\":\"Moon Elf Queen and his most cherished champion\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"floryn\",\"heroName\":\"Floryn\",\"relationship\":\"Flower spirit whose nature magic harmonizes with his lunar healing\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"helcurt\",\"heroName\":\"Helcurt\",\"relationship\":\"Shadow creature whose darkness extinguishes his moonlight\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"dyrroth\",\"heroName\":\"Dyrroth\",\"relationship\":\"Abyssal prince who corrupted the Moonlight Forest\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"$undefined\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"dat